{"title":"Flocked Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFlocked Artificial Christmas Trees: What to Know\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFlocked artificial Christmas trees are designed to capture the look of a snow-covered evergreen while offering the durability and convenience of an artificial tree. With branches dusted in soft white flocking, these trees bring a winter-inspired feel to your holiday décor without the mess or maintenance of real snow.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAt King of Christmas, our flocked tree collection features a wide range of styles and sizes, from full and traditional to slim and sparse to create the holiday winter wonderland you’ve always imagined.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat is a flocked Christmas Tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eA flocked Christmas tree is an evergreen artificial Christmas tree with branches coated in a soft, snow-like material to mimic the appearance of a tree covered in fresh snowfall. The flocking is made out of a cotton-based material to adhere to the branches while maintaining a soft, realistic finish. This creates a unique and elevated alternative to traditional green Christmas trees, adding depth, texture, and a winter-inspired aesthetic to your holiday décor. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas offers both pre-lit and unlit flocked artificial Christmas trees. Our pre-lit flocked trees feature professionally installed micro LED lights that are carefully placed beneath the flocking to create a soft, warm, and evenly distributed glow.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat sizes and styles do flocked artificial Christmas trees come in?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFlocked artificial Christmas trees are available in a variety of sizes and silhouettes to fit any home. Choose from full and traditional trees for a grand holiday centerpiece or sparse and slim flocked Christmas trees designed for apartments and smaller spaces. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWith heights ranging from 6 to 12 feet, it’s easy to find a flocked Christmas tree that fits your space while creating a beautiful winter-inspired display.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat are the best-selling flocked Christmas trees?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas is known for its realistic and natural looking flocked artificial Christmas trees. Some of our best selling flocked trees include the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"King Flock Artificial Christmas Tree\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing Flock\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/queen-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"Queen Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eQueen Flock\u003c\/a\u003e, both designed with full, traditional silhouettes and densely packed branches that create a beautiful snow-covered holiday centerpiece. These styles are available in both full and slim options to suit a variety of spaces.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eIf you prefer a more minimal and unique design, our best-selling King Noble is also available in a flocked style. The \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-noble-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"King Noble Artificial Christmas Trees\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing Noble Flock\u003c\/a\u003e is loved for its elegant, slightly sparse silhouette and easy assembly, making it a great option for homes looking for a refined or minimalistic winter-inspired tree.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose a King of Christmas flocked artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFlocked artificial Christmas trees are perfect for creating a cozy, winter-inspired look inside your home. With snow-dusted branches, they offer a softer, more elevated alternative to traditional \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/green-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Green Artificial Christmas Trees\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003egreen trees\u003c\/a\u003e, making them ideal for those who want a more modern or designer-inspired holiday aesthetic.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cspan\u003eEvery King of Christmas flocked tree ships free right to your door anywhere in the contiguous USA. Plus, with our 2-year warranty, you can shop with confidence and look forward to many seasons of holiday magic. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003eExclusions apply - final sale and clearance items are covered by a 90-day warranty. See our \u003ca title=\"FAQ's\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/pages\/faq\"\u003eFAQ page\u003c\/a\u003e for more information.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eDo flocked Christmas trees shed? \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFlocked Christmas trees may experience light shedding during the initial setup and takedown process. Once the tree is fully assembled and the branches are fluffed, shedding is typically minimal so you can enjoy the snowy appearance of your King of Christmas tree throughout the holiday seasons. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFlocked vs. Green Christmas Trees: Which is better?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eChoosing between a flocked and traditional green Christmas tree comes down to personal style.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFlocked Christmas trees offer a winter-inspired, snow-covered look that creates a cozy and decorative statement, while green trees provide a more classic and traditional holiday appearance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eIf you’re looking to create a seasonal, snowy aesthetic, a flocked tree is an excellent choice. For a timeless and natural look, a traditional green tree may be the better fit.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you’re looking to create a cozy winter scene or add a unique statement piece to your holiday décor, flocked artificial Christmas trees offer a beautiful blend of elegance, texture, and seasonal charm. Explore our collection or take the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/a\/p\/find-the-perfect-christmas-tree?instore=true#\/\" title=\"Find The Perfect Christmas Tree\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eTree Quiz\u003c\/a\u003e to find the perfect tree for your home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb id=\"docs-internal-guid-708a2865-7fff-9490-27d7-0a66456e1729\"\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"8-foot-prince-flock-tree-unlit","title":"8' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"8' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642895167552,"sku":"PF-T8-U","price":219.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-11_5e399119-a4fe-4d26-8c77-bde58886c97f.jpg?v=1718158952"},{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"7-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"7' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","descr